034_knowledge_bank.sql was added in b683deac and deleted in a6a57f3f, having
shipped in v0.42.0 through v0.46.0 and on main. The knowledge bank moved to a
remote MCP server with its own store, so the table it created is no longer part
of the web extension.

The deletion did not record the number anywhere, which left 034 looking free to
`ls` while every database from v0.42.0 on had it applied. That is the hazard
this file closes.
